        "content": "## Myworkingmemory Curated Finds via RapidAPI\nInstall n8n-nodes-curated-finds@0.2.0. Use your Software Library Search subscription from https://rapidapi.com/Myworkingmemory/api/software-library-search. Select Connection: RapidAPI and create a Myworkingmemory Curated Finds (RapidAPI) API credential using your X-RapidAPI-Key.\n\nEach credential test sends one real request. Each execution sends one further request. RapidAPI plan allowance, charges and n8n hosting/model costs are separate. A one-request free plan can be consumed by the credential test. No automatic pagination or node retries. nextOffset is calculated from the page; remaining plan quota is not supplied in the JSON. Source-reviewed records are not runtime guarantees.",
